{"title": "Light Magic Armour Trader Table", "pageid": 14885, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Light_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Leveled drop tables", "Vendor tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Light Magic Armour Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Light_Magic</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Light_Magic+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Light_Magic+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing enchanted <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#Light_Armour\" title=\"Armour\">light armour</a>. It only starts dropping items after level 2.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Light Magic Armour Trader Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<i>Every item that the player is eligible for is dropped. E.g. at level 4, both Padded Armour +1 and Leather Armour +1 are dropped.</i><table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 2 - 4\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Padded_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Padded Armour +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Padded_Armour_PlusOne_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Padded_Armour_PlusOne_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Padded_Armour_PlusOne_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Padded_Armour_PlusOne_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/77/Padded_Armour_PlusOne_B_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Padded_Armour_PlusOne_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Padded_Armour_PlusOne_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Padded_Armour_PlusOne_B_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Padded_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Padded Armour +1\">Padded Armour +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 4 - 6\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Leather Armour +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Leather Armour +1\">Leather Armour +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 5 - 8\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Padded_Armour_%2B2\" title=\"Padded Armour +2\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Padded_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Padded_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Padded_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Padded_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/6/6f/Padded_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Padded_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Padded_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Padded_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Padded_Armour_%2B2\" title=\"Padded Armour +2\">Padded Armour +2</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 6 - 8\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Studded Leather Armour +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Studded Leather Armour +1\">Studded Leather Armour +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 7+\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour_%2B2\" title=\"Leather Armour +2\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/23/Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour_%2B2\" title=\"Leather Armour +2\">Leather Armour +2</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 9+\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B2\" title=\"Studded Leather Armour +2\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Studded_Leather_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Studded_Leather_Armour_%2B2\" title=\"Studded Leather Armour +2\">Studded Leather Armour +2</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202550\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2930/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26757/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument 